WEBVTT

00:03:29.913 --> 00:03:32.329
where we are trying to design
a robot health coach.

00:03:32.371 --> 00:03:34.246
And so, I have an exercise physiologist

00:03:34.288 --> 00:03:36.288
showing the robot
how to do some exercises.

00:03:36.329 --> 00:03:37.871
You know, we want to get strong.

00:03:37.913 --> 00:03:40.204
And then, the other thing is learning.

00:03:40.246 --> 00:03:41.704
So, learning is important.

00:03:41.746 --> 00:03:43.496
We do this as children,

00:03:43.538 --> 00:03:46.121
we do this even as adults,
we do this as elder.

00:03:46.704 --> 00:03:48.913
And yet, one form of learning
is muscle memory.

00:03:48.954 --> 00:03:51.788
So how many of you play an instrument?

00:03:52.038 --> 00:03:54.996
When you start off, for example,
if you think about the violin,

00:03:55.038 --> 00:03:57.579
you start off and your instructor
might actually come

00:03:57.621 --> 00:04:00.621
and move your hand a little bit
or move your bow a bit up.